<title>INDIA: India appoints new army chief.</title>
<headline>India appoints new army chief.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>India on Friday named the new chief of  the world's fourth largest army.</p>
<p>Lieutenant-General Ved Prakash Malik, 57, takes over from Shankar  Roy Chowdhury, who retires on September 30, the Defence Ministry said.</p>
